   "fix": "Reword, e.g.: 'Capping native relative small cycles with a cocycle `\u03b1` and applying the singular Mayer\u2013Vietoris \u03b4 equals `(-1)^(p+1)` times the localized cap, in `U \u2293 V`, with the connecting cocycle `\u03b6`, the common coboundary of lifts of `\u03b1` to the two complements.'",
